activity Identify Threat
activity Collect Data
activity Analyze Data
activity Report Threat
activity Mitigate Threat
activity Monitor Systems
activity Update Threat Intelligence
activity Conduct Training
activity Perform Incident Response
bind Identify Threat: Threat ID, Threat Type
bind Collect Data: Threat ID, Data Source ID
bind Analyze Data: Threat ID, Analysis Result
bind Report Threat: Threat ID, Report ID
bind Mitigate Threat: Threat ID, Mitigation Success Rate
bind Monitor Systems: Threat ID, Monitoring Status
bind Update Threat Intelligence: Update ID, Threat ID
bind Conduct Training: 
bind Perform Incident Response: 
Threat ID: integer between 1 and 999999
Threat Type: Phishing, Malware, DDoS, Ransomware
Data Source ID: integer between 1 and 99999
Analysis Result: Confirmed, False Positive, Inconclusive
Report ID: integer between 1 and 99999
Mitigation Success Rate: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Monitoring Status: Ongoing, Completed
Update ID: integer between 1 and 99999
Init[Identify Threat] | |
End[Monitor Systems] | |
Response[Identify Threat, Collect Data] | |A.Threat ID == T.Threat ID |
Response[Collect Data, Analyze Data] | |A.Threat ID == T.Threat ID |
Response[Analyze Data, Report Threat] |A.Analysis Result is Confirmed |A.Threat ID == T.Threat ID |
Response[Report Threat, Mitigate Threat] | |A.Threat ID == T.Threat ID |
Response[Mitigate Threat, Monitor Systems] | |A.Threat ID == T.Threat ID |
Response[Mitigate Threat, Update Threat Intelligence] |A.Mitigation Success Rate > 90.0 |A.Threat ID == T.Threat ID |
Chain Response[Collect Data, Analyze Data] | |A.Threat ID == T.Threat ID |
Chain Response[Report Threat, Mitigate Threat] | |A.Threat ID == T.Threat ID |
Chain Response[Mitigate Threat, Monitor Systems] | |A.Threat ID == T.Threat ID |
Precedence[Identify Threat, Collect Data] | |A.Threat ID == T.Threat ID |
Precedence[Collect Data, Analyze Data] | |A.Threat ID == T.Threat ID |
Precedence[Analyze Data, Report Threat] | |A.Threat ID == T.Threat ID |
Precedence[Report Threat, Mitigate Threat] | |A.Threat ID == T.Threat ID |
Precedence[Mitigate Threat, Monitor Systems] | |A.Threat ID == T.Threat ID |